WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Storing drinking water at home.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Store at least one gallon of water per person per day.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Keep enough water for at least three days.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Use clean, food-grade containers with tight caps.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Replace stored tap water every six months.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Label each container with the date you filled it.
